{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"余滤极限"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"余滤极限"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 中的<strong>余滤极限</strong> (cofiltered limit) 是以"},{"Local":{"url":"余滤范畴","text":"余滤范畴"}},{"Plain":" $I$ 为形状的图表 $I\\to\\mathcal C$ 的极限, 相当于对偶范畴 $\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}$ 中的"},{"Local":{"url":"滤余极限","text":"滤余极限"}},{"Plain":" (filtered colimit).</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"p-进整数","text":"$p$-进整数环"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbb{Z}_p$ 是余滤极限\n$$\r\n\\mathbb{Z}_p = \\operatorname{lim}_n \\mathbb{Z}/(p^n).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"平展基本群","text":"平展基本群"}},{"Plain":"是有限平展覆叠的自同构群的余滤极限. 例如在 $\\mathbb{C}$ 上有\n$$\r\n\\pi_1^{\\text{\\'et}}(\\mathbb G_m) = \\operatorname{lim}_n \\mathbb{Z}/(n) = \\widehat {\\mathbb{Z}}.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}